sentences.text:
The present petition has been preferred for the following relief/s:
(i) for issuance of writ in the nature of Mandamus or any other appropriate writ/order or direction to the respondent to pay the compensation of the entire land in question as per the Right to fair Patna High Court CWJC No.16001 of 2017(2)
dt.05-05-2025 compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013 to the petitioner and to quash the order dated 03.07.2017 passed by Arbitrator;
Smt. Sitapati Devi vs The State Of Bihar And Ors on 5 May, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/165605451/
1 (ii) for issuance of wit of mandamus or any other appropriate writ /order or direction respondents to determine/calculate to the compensation as per market value of land and interest, cost etc. taking into account the nature of land as mentioned in the representation of petitioner submitted to respondent no. 5;
(iii) for any other appropriate writ for which the petitioner is otherwise entitled in the eye of law.
